OL,3,GNEWSAMum says 'no fat left to trim' on
OL,4,Ahousehold costs amid 42% rise in water
OL,5,Abills
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mum says there is "no more fat left
OL,8,Fto trim" off her household bills
OL,9,Fdespite making changes at home to use
OL,10,Fless water.
OL,12,FVictoria Owen said she had implemented
OL,13,Fa "don't waste it" rule, encouraging
OL,14,Fher children to have short showers and
OL,15,Fre-use the water after washing dishes.
OL,17,FIt comes after water companies across
OL,18,FEngland and Wales were given the green
OL,19,Flight to increase bills for customers
OL,20,Fby an extra #3.4bn in the coming years,
OL,21,Fto meet increased pressures on
OL,22,Finfrastructure and the environment.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
