OL,3,GNEWSAMum says 'no fat left to trim' on
OL,4,Ahousehold costs amid 42% rise in water
OL,5,Abills
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh Water, Wales' main water and
OL,8,Fsewerage supplier, said it was working
OL,9,Fto support its most vulnerable
OL,10,Fcustomers and planned to invest #4.2bn
OL,11,Fby 2030 to improve services.
